.claude/
# Ignore everything in docs/ EXCEPT the README screenshots so GitHub
# can render the hero shots. Excluding `docs/` as a directory wholesale
# makes negation on children useless (git stops recursing), so this
# pattern lists the contents and then re-includes the screenshots.
docs/*
!docs/screenshots/
!docs/screenshots/**